{"symbol":"MNC.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:53:28Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Ciasna 6","city":"Warsaw","zip":"00-232","country":"Poland","phone":"48 22 656 4200","website":"https://www.mennica.com.pl","industry":"Metal Fabrication","industryKey":"metal-fabrication","industryDisp":"Metal Fabrication","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Mennica Polska S.A. manufactures and distributes mint products, investment products, and engraving and medal products in Poland. The company operates through four segments: Mint Products, Electronic Payments, Property Rental, and Property Development. It produces and sells mint products, including circulation and collector coins; gold and silver investment products comprising bars and bullion coins; tokens and other mint products; and engraved/medallist products, such as medals, decorations, badges, seals, date stamps, and assay marks, as well as engages in the marketing and sale activities relating to the promotion and distribution of collector coins, numismatic products, and investment products consist of gold bars and bullion coins. It is also involved in electronic payments, including operation of city card systems, sale of public transport and railway tickets, prepaid cards, maintenance services, and sale of technical equipment, as well as design, implementation, and maintenance of public transport fare collection systems, as well as distribution of electronic and paper tickets; and ticket sales through e-commerce and mobile channels. In addition, the company engages in the execution of property development projects; leases office, warehouse spaces, and commercial premises; property management; and other investment activities, as well as manages rental spaces. It serves bank, foreign issuers, domestic and foreign distributors of mint products, collectors, investors, and corporations interested in token products; local governments operating public transport, railway companies, and private individuals; and institutional customers. The company also exports its products. Mennica Polska S.A. was founded in 1766 and is based in Warsaw, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":422,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Katarzyna  Budnicka-Filipiuk","title":"President of the Management Board & CEO","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Malgorzata  Lis-Wasowska","title":"Member of the Management Board for Finance","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Siemowit  Kalukiewicz","title":"Member of the Management Board for Monetary Production & Logistics","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Pawel Tomasz Brukszo","title":"Secretary","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":37.8,"open":37.2,"dayLow":37.2,"dayHigh":38.4,"regularMarketPreviousClose":37.8,"regularMarketOpen":37.2,"regularMarketDayLow":37.2,"regularMarketDayHigh":38.4,"dividendRate":1.5,"dividendYield":3.97,"exDividendDate":1780012800,"payoutRatio":0.4274,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":1.92,"beta":0.556,"trailingPE":10.9117,"volume":617,"regularMarketVolume":617,"averageVolume":2552,"averageVolume10days":2001,"averageDailyVolume10Day":2001,"bid":37.5,"ask":38.3,"marketCap":1953239552,"nonDilutedMarketCap":1927740502,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":31.4,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":59,"allTimeHigh":59,"allTimeLow":1.85,"fulldayPrice":38.3,"fulldayChange":0.5,"fulldayChangePercent":1.32275,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.692885,"fiftyDayAverage":39.154,"twoHundredDayAverage":42.3945,"trailingAnnualDividendRate":1.5,"trailingAnnualDividendYield":0.0396825,"currency":"PLN","tradeable":false,"enterpriseValue":2805592576,"profitMargins":0.0636,"floatShares":19757300,"sharesOutstanding":50998426,"heldPercentInsiders":0.62051,"heldPercentInstitutions":0.243,"impliedSharesOutstanding":50998426,"bookValue":23.59,"priceToBook":1.62357,"lastFiscalYearEnd":1767139200,"ne